{
  "title": "ISA-Tox RO-Crate Profile",
  "description": "<p>An RO-Crate profile for <em>in vitro</em> toxicology studies and New Approach Methodologies. It extends the ISA RO-Crate Profile with ontology-backed requirements on chemicals, test systems and the four experimental step types, and with SHACL shapes that check them.</p><p>Specification text CC BY 4.0; the SHACL shapes are MIT and live in the reference implementation, <a href=\"https://github.com/johannehouweling/vitro-crate\">vitro-crate</a>.</p>",
